# Ingest exclusion list (books)
#
# Each *.txt file here marks one Goodreads book to keep OUT of the archive,
# even though it's still on the "read" shelf. The build-time ingest
# (scripts/ingest-goodreads.js) reads every *.txt in this folder and skips any
# feed entry whose goodreads_link matches a line in one of them.
#
# Filename convention: <goodreads-book-id>.txt  (e.g. 12345.txt)
# File contents:       the full goodreads_link, e.g.
#                      https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/12345
#
# These markers are written automatically when you delete a book in the admin,
# but you can also add or remove them by hand. Removing a marker lets the book
# be re-ingested on the next build.
